{"seq":1,"slug":"trade-credit-insurance-factoring-model","title":"贸易信用保险、保理与福费廷模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-trade-finance-lc-guarantee-credit-insurance/credit-insurance-financing-ops/trade-credit-insurance-factoring-model","wordCount":2906,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"贸易信用保险-保理与福费廷模型\">贸易信用保险、保理与福费廷模型</h1><p>跨境赊销订单最怕的不是没利润，而是货发了、账飞了。信用证能把付款义务挪到银行身上，但代价是开证额度、审单成本和单据瑕疵；多数中小跨境电商面对的是 30/60/90 天赊销账期，靠的是另一种工具组合：<strong>贸易信用保险</strong>兜住买方坏账、<strong>保理</strong>把应收账款提前变现、<strong>福费廷</strong>做无追索的买断。三者不是竞品，而是一条从&quot;承保风险&quot;到&quot;转让风险&quot;再到&quot;彻底出表&quot;的连续梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类工具谁承担买方信用风险\">核心概念：三类工具谁承担买方信用风险</h2><p>先明确一个坐标轴：一笔赊销应收账款上有两个风险——<strong>买方信用风险</strong>（买方不付钱）和<strong>融资流动性风险</strong>（钱回来之前我没有现金）。保险、保理、福费廷分别落在不同位置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>转移的是</th>\n<th>追索权</th>\n<th>典型期限</th>\n<th>出口商账面效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>贸易信用保险</td>\n<td>买方信用风险（部分）</td>\n<td>保单不追索，但保留自留额</td>\n<td>短期（通常 ≤180 天）</td>\n<td>应收账款仍在表内，需计提准备金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保理（无追索）</td>\n<td>信用风险 + 流动性</td>\n<td>无追索</td>\n<td>短期</td>\n<td>应收账款出表，转为现金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保理（有追索）</td>\n<td>只有流动性</td>\n<td>有追索（坏账回退卖方）</td>\n<td>短期</td>\n<td>本质是质押融资，仍在表内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>福费廷</td>\n<td>信用风险 + 政治风险 + 流动性</td>\n<td>无追索</td>\n<td>中长期（90 天至数年）</td>\n<td>应收账款彻底出表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了为什么保险和保理经常<strong>叠加使用</strong>：卖方先买入信用保险，把保单权益转让给保理商（assign policy proceeds），保理商因为有了保险兜底，愿意接受更高的预付款比例、更低的费率，甚至做无追索保理。保单在贸易融资里是<strong>可抵押的信用增级资产</strong>，这层关系在 <a href=\"credit-limit-underwriting-claim\">信用限额核保与索赔</a> 里展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[出口商赊销发货&lt;br/&gt;形成应收账款] --&gt; B{需要什么?}&#10;  B --&gt;|只兜坏账| C[贸易信用保险&lt;br/&gt;承保额度内赔付约定比例]&#10;  B --&gt;|要提前拿现金| D[保理&lt;br/&gt;预付款+到期结算余额]&#10;  B --&gt;|要彻底出表+中长期| E[福费廷&lt;br/&gt;无追索买断]&#10;  C --&gt;|转让保单权益| D&#10;  D --&gt;|有追索: 坏账回退卖方| F[卖方仍承担信用风险]&#10;  D --&gt;|无追索: 保理商承担| G[风险转移给保理商]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  C --&gt;|保费| H[保险公司按&lt;PD*LGD&gt;定价]\">flowchart TD\n  A[出口商赊销发货&lt;br/&gt;形成应收账款] --&gt; B{需要什么?}\n  B --&gt;|只兜坏账| C[贸易信用保险&lt;br/&gt;承保额度内赔付约定比例]\n  B --&gt;|要提前拿现金| D[保理&lt;br/&gt;预付款+到期结算余额]\n  B --&gt;|要彻底出表+中长期| E[福费廷&lt;br/&gt;无追索买断]\n  C --&gt;|转让保单权益| D\n  D --&gt;|有追索: 坏账回退卖方| F[卖方仍承担信用风险]\n  D --&gt;|无追索: 保理商承担| G[风险转移给保理商]\n  E --&gt; G\n  C --&gt;|保费| H[保险公司按&lt;PD*LGD&gt;定价]</pre><h2 id=\"贸易信用保险-保单结构-承保比例与信用限额\">贸易信用保险：保单结构、承保比例与信用限额</h2><p>贸易信用保险（trade credit insurance）承保的是应收账款因买方<strong>长期拖欠（protracted default）、无力偿付（insolvency）或破产（bankruptcy）<strong>造成的损失；可选加保</strong>政治风险</strong>——买方所在国的外汇管制、政治动荡、征用导致的拒付。它面向企业而非个人，企业不能为个人账单投保。</p>\n<p>保单的三个核心参数决定实际保护力度：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>承保比例（coverage percentage）</strong>：保险公司按约定的比例赔付未收回的发票金额，而非 100%。行业惯例是<strong>保留 10%–20% 的自留额（deductible/retention）</strong>，让投保人始终有追讨动机。这正是保单与&quot;全额保障&quot;的分界线——卖方永远要自担一截损失。</li>\n<li><strong>信用限额（credit limit）</strong>：投保人必须<strong>逐买方申请信用限额</strong>，只有限额内的销售才被承保。超出限额的发货不受保护，这是实务中最容易被忽略的敞口。限额可临时申请临时额度（ discretionary limit）应对急单。</li>\n<li><strong>承保范围（scope）</strong>：可以是整个买方组合的全周转保单（whole-turnover），也可以是单一买方或单笔交易保单。全周转保单费率更低，但要求把全部符合条件销售都纳入，避免&quot;逆向选择&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>保费的计收方式通常是<strong>按月计费</strong>——按当月销售额的百分比，或按未到期应收余额的百分比，费率反映的是整个被保买方组合的平均信用风险。保费定价的底层是期望损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EL = PD \\times LGD \\times EAD,\\qquad \\Pi = EL \\times (1 + \\ell)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为买方违约概率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LGD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为违约损失率（约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span> 承保比例，加上追偿回收的调整）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为风险敞口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 是保险公司的费用与利润加成。卖方加保政治风险，等于在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 上再叠加一个国别风险因子。</p>\n<p>市场结构高度集中：三大私营信用保险集团——<strong>Allianz Trade（原 Euler Hermes）、Coface、Atradius</strong>——合计占全球私营信用保险市场 85% 以上；其余由各国出口信用机构（ECA）补充，如中国的<strong>中国出口信用保险公司（SINOSURE，中信保）</strong>、各国 Berne Union 成员机构。Berne Union（伯尔尼联盟）是出口信用与投资保险业的国际组织，其成员既包括官方 ECA 也包括私营保险人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保理-有追索-无追索与双保理体系\">保理：有追索、无追索与双保理体系</h2><p>保理（factoring）的本质是<strong>应收账款所有权的转让</strong>，而非贷款——这也是它和有追索质押融资在会计处理上分道扬镳的地方。核心流程是：卖方向保理商提交发票，保理商<strong>按预付款比例（advance rate，通常 80%–85%）<strong>先垫付现金，余款进入</strong>准备金账户（reserve，通常为信用额度的 10%–15%）</strong>；到期收妥后，扣掉保理费再把余额退还卖方。保理费按面值百分比计，例如一张 45 天到期的发票收 5% 费率。</p>\n<p>关键分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有追索保理（recourse）</strong>：买方到期不付，保理商可向卖方<strong>追回</strong>已垫款项。信用风险仍在卖方，保理商只是提供融资。</li>\n<li><strong>无追索保理（non-recourse）</strong>：买方因<strong>财务上无力偿付</strong>而不付时，损失由保理商承担——在 US GAAP 下通常构成&quot;出售&quot;（sale）而非担保贷款，可以实现<strong>应收账款出表</strong>。注意：因货物质量争议、商业纠纷导致的拒付，仍不在无追索范围内。</li>\n<li><strong>反向保理 / 供应链金融（reverse factoring）</strong>：由<strong>买方</strong>发起，买方把自己的债务卖给保理商，用买方的高信用评级为供应商换取更低利率。跨境电商平台（如 Amazon、Temu、SHEIN 的供应链体系）提供的提前回款工具，本质都是反向保理。</li>\n<li><strong>票据贴现（invoice discounting）</strong>：英国法下视为保密的保理，通常不通知买方、卖方继续自己收款；美国法则视为以应收为担保的借款（assignment of accounts receivable）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>跨境保理要靠双保理体系（two-factor system）</strong>：出口商委托本国<strong>出口保理商（export factor）</strong>，出口保理商再委托买方所在国的<strong>进口保理商（import factor）</strong>，由后者做本地买方信用评估、催收和承担坏账。这样出口商不需要自己去理解外国买方的信用状况和当地法律。全球两大保理行业组织——**FCI（Factors Chain International）**与 <strong>IFG（International Factors Group）</strong>——在 2016 年整合为统一的 FCI，其规则体系（GRIF，General Rules for International Factoring）为双保理提供标准操作与仲裁框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"福费廷-无追索买断与-urf-800-规则\">福费廷：无追索买断与 URF 800 规则</h2><p>福费廷（forfaiting）与保理最大的区别在<strong>期限</strong>和<strong>出表彻底程度</strong>：它针对<strong>中长期</strong>（90 天到数年）的出口应收款，由福费廷商（forfaiter）以<strong>无追索（without recourse）<strong>方式买断。买断的载体通常是</strong>本票（promissory note）、汇票（bill of exchange）、延期付款信用证（deferred-payment L/C）或福费廷担保函（letter of forfaiting）</strong>。因为无追索，福费廷商承担买方信用风险、买方国别风险、银行风险与利率风险，所以定价里隐含了完整的风险溢价。</p>\n<p>福费廷的标准规则是国际商会的 <strong>URF 800（Uniform Rules for Forfaiting，ICC Publication No. 800，2013 年 1 月 1 日生效）</strong>，它把福费廷拆成**一级市场（primary market，原始买断）<strong>和</strong>二级市场（secondary market，权利再转让）**两套协议模板，解决了此前每笔交易都要逐条谈判的痛点。与信用证体系的关系是：<strong>延期付款信用证 + 福费廷</strong>是跨境电商大额 B2B 订单最常见的组合——用 L/C 确立银行付款义务（UCP600 框架），再用福费廷把银行的延期付款义务提前变现。这与 <a href=\"../documentary-credit-ucp600-practice/discrepancy-acceptance-transfer-fraud\">信用证脱手与转让保险</a> 中讨论的转让机制是同一层逻辑：把付款承诺从&quot;承诺&quot;变成&quot;可变现资产&quot;。</p>\n<p>票据权利的电子化是 2026 年的关键变量。UNCITRAL 的 **《电子可转让记录示范法》（MLETR，2017）**为电子提单、电子汇票提供法律承认基础；英国 **《2023 年电子贸易单据法》（Electronic Trade Documents Act 2023）**已明确电子提单等与纸质单据具有同等法律效力。相应地，ICC 发布了电子规则补充：<strong>eUCP Version 2.1</strong> 与 <strong>eURC Version 1.1</strong>（均 2019 年 7 月 1 日生效），为纯电子交单提供规则基础。</p>\n<p>福费廷买断价按贴现计算。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 为票据面值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为年贴现率、以天数计息，货币市场法为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mtext>天数</mtext><mtext>年基准</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = F\\left(1 - d \\cdot \\frac{\\text{天数}}{\\text{年基准}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年基准</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若按复利折现、期限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 年，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = F/(1+d)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。福费廷商的贴现率是基准利率（SOFR/EURIBOR 等）加信用、国别、期限溢价之和，这决定了它是三种工具中<strong>单位成本最高</strong>、但也是<strong>唯一能覆盖中长期敞口并彻底出表</strong>的一种。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融资成本与工具选择的定量判据\">融资成本与工具选择的定量判据</h2><p>把三种工具放到同一张成本表上，选择就变成一个可算的决策。设赊销账期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（天）、货款面值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>、卖方资金成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、保理费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、福费廷贴现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{for}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、信用保险保费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{ins}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（按销售额计）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>保险</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>覆盖率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{保险}} \\approx p_{ins}\\cdot F + (1-\\text{覆盖率})\\cdot EL \\cdot F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保险</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">覆盖率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>保理</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>垫款额</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>360</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{保理}} \\approx f_f \\cdot F + r_w \\cdot \\text{垫款额} \\cdot \\frac{T}{360}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保理</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">垫款额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">360</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>保理的净收益在于<strong>把账期资金提前释放</strong>，只有当&quot;提前回款带来的资金收益/再投资收益&quot;大于保理费时，保理才划算。而福费廷的判据不同——它牺牲的是利差，换的是<strong>风险与账期的彻底转移</strong>，因此更适合买方所在国有政治风险、或卖方需要改善报表杠杆的场景。跨境电商中小卖家真正的高频组合是：<strong>信用保险兜底 + 有追索保理融资</strong>（成本最低但风险留给自己），只有遇到大额、中长期、高国别风险的订单，才升级到无追索保理或福费廷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把三种工具映射回一笔真实订单：赊销发货后先看买方信用，用贸易信用保险按信用限额兜住坏账；需要现金流时对有保险覆盖的应收做保理，保单权益转让可抬高预付款比例、压低费率；若是大额中长期订单，用延期付款信用证确立银行付款义务，再通过福费廷无追索买断彻底出表。三者的选择判据是三个正交问题——<strong>风险转移多少（追索权）</strong>、<strong>资金释放多快（账期 vs 成本）</strong>、<strong>是否出表（会计与报表效果）</strong>。三个工具都不是免费的午餐：保险留下自留额、保理留下追索条款和准备金占用、福费廷的贴现率最贵。真正的工程问题不是&quot;选哪个最好&quot;，而是<strong>同一笔订单上如何叠加它们</strong>——用保险提高保理的预付款比例、用 L/C 为福费廷提供可买断的银行义务基础。这条组合链条的执行细节、逾期管理与坏账指标，见本节的 <a href=\"financing-ops-overdue-bad-debt-metrics\">融资运营、逾期与坏账指标</a>；而银行保函与备用证如何为融资提供反担保，见 <a href=\"../guarantee-collection-switf-trade-docs/bank-guarantee-standby-lc-structure\">银行保函与备用证结构</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贸易信用保险、保理与福费廷模型","id":"贸易信用保险-保理与福费廷模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类工具谁承担买方信用风险","id":"核心概念-三类工具谁承担买方信用风险"},{"level":2,"text":"贸易信用保险：保单结构、承保比例与信用限额","id":"贸易信用保险-保单结构-承保比例与信用限额"},{"level":2,"text":"保理：有追索、无追索与双保理体系","id":"保理-有追索-无追索与双保理体系"},{"level":2,"text":"福费廷：无追索买断与 URF 800 规则","id":"福费廷-无追索买断与-urf-800-规则"},{"level":2,"text":"融资成本与工具选择的定量判据","id":"融资成本与工具选择的定量判据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SWIFT MT7xx 报文与单证流自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-trade-finance-lc-guarantee-credit-insurance/guarantee-collection-switf-trade-docs/swift-mt7xx-message-document-flow"},"next":{"title":"信用额度核定、承保与索赔机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-trade-finance-lc-guarantee-credit-insurance/credit-insurance-financing-ops/credit-limit-underwriting-claim"}}